                <title><![CDATA[【Requests】[REQ VID] - HANNAH MONTANA FANS! Typhoon Lagoon Performance somewhere on DVD ??]]></title>
                <link><![CDATA[https://sharemania.us/threads/hannah-montana-fans-typhoon-lagoon-performance-somewhere-on-dvd.297055/]]></link>
                <description><![CDATA[<article>
				<blockquote class="messageText SelectQuoteContainer ugc baseHtml">
					
					I think that Hannah Montana's 2006 performance at Disney's Typhoon Lagoon might be somewhere on DVD, here's why.<br>
<br>
So I'm used to the 8 minute version that aired on TV with the big ass Disney Channel +1 logo, but I just noticed these different uploads with each songs, that don't have that logo. Instead, they have a text at the beggining and end of the songs, which is typical of music videos or performances on Disney DVD's.<br>
<br>
Here's the TV version<br>
<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bH6-6HKBAcE&amp;list=RDbH6-6HKBAcE&amp;start_radio=1" target="_blank" class="externalLink" rel="nofollow">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bH6-6HKBAcE</a><br>
<br>
And some individual performances<br>
<span data-s9e-mediaembed="youtube" style="display:inline-block;width:100%;max-width:640px"><span style="display:block;overflow:hidden;position:relative;padding-bottom:56.25%"><iframe allowfullscreen="" loading="lazy" scrolling="no" style="background:url(https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3gXfVjBhA3o/hqdefault.jpg) 50% 50% / cover;border:0;height:100%;left:0;position:absolute;width:100%" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/3gXfVjBhA3o"></iframe></span></span><br>
<span data-s9e-mediaembed="youtube" style="display:inline-block;width:100%;max-width:640px"><span style="display:block;overflow:hidden;position:relative;padding-bottom:56.25%"><iframe allowfullscreen="" loading="lazy" scrolling="no" style="background:url(https://i.ytimg.com/vi/qyto-CHXPZs/hqdefault.jpg) 50% 50% / cover;border:0;height:100%;left:0;position:absolute;width:100%" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/qyto-CHXPZs"></iframe></span></span><br>
<br>
On the videos it says "Soundtrack coming this fall", so I really think that these are on a 2006 Disney DVD to promote Hannah. We really should dig to find out the source of these, because we could finally have the best quality of this little concert.
